VulkanPT (pt::)

Reusable VulkanWrapper diffuse path tracer with area-light next-event
sampling, R2 low-discrepancy light rays, multi-bounce transport, Russian
roulette, jittered rays, FP32 progressive history, geometry-validated
reprojection, and display-only spatial denoising.
Public API: pt/pt.hpp. Shader sources: shaders/.
Accepts independent triangle/quad surfaces, one selected emissive area
light, camera position/orientation/FOV and render resolution.
Host owns Vulkan device, commands, presentation and synchronization.
